==French==

===Etymology===
Probably from {{etyl|LL.|fr}} *{{term||(in) hanc hora|until this hour}} < {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|hanc|lang=la}} {{term|hora|lang=la}}. Compare Occitan {{term|encara|lang=oc}}, Italian {{term|ancora|lang=it}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɑ̃.kɔʁ/|lang=fr}}
* {{audio|fr-encore.ogg|Audio (France)|lang=fr}}

===Adverb===
{{fr-adv}}

# [[still]]
#: ''Êtes-vous '''encore''' là?''
#:: Are you '''still''' there?
# [[more]]
#: ''Voulez-vous '''encore''' du [[pain]]?''
#:: Would you like '''more''' [[bread]]?
#: ''Tu en veux '''encore'''?''
#:: You want some '''more'''?
# [[again]]
#: '''''Encore''' une fois.''
#:: Once '''again'''.
# [[yet]]
#: ''Je n'ai pas '''encore''' fini.''
#:: I haven't finished '''yet'''

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|still}} [[toujours]]

